        1   using Progress.Lang.*.
        2   using ibs.th.gbl.*.
        3   block-level on error undo, throw.
        4   class ibs.th.skt.ControlledClients.flagsdoc inherits flags:
        5     define property isDocMarkOn as logical no-undo
        6       get:
        7         return getflag (1).
        8       end.
        9       set (arg as log):
       10          setFlag (1,arg).
       11       end.
       12   end class.
